{"id":"molcha","lemma":"молча","pos":"adv","rank":4535,"glosses":["silently, tacitly","speechlessly"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/16/Ru-%D0%BC%D0%BE%D0%BB%D1%87%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%BC%D0%BE%D0%BB%D1%87%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Он молча вышел из комнаты.","en":"He silently went out of the room.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"to exit, to go out","l":"выйти"},{"g":"from / out of"},{"g":"room","l":"комната"}]},{"text":"Я просто молча пошёл домой.","en":"I just went home without saying anything.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"simply, plainly, just"},null,{"g":"to go","l":"пойти"},{"g":"home"}]},{"text":"Они молча кивнули.","en":"They nodded silently.","words":[{"g":"they"},null,null]},{"text":"Мы шли молча.","en":"We walked in silence.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/738499","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to send, to dispatch","l":"слать"},null]},{"text":"Том стоял молча.","en":"Tom stood silently.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to stand","l":"стоять"},null]}]}